window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The highly anticipated sequel to the #1 <i>New York Times</i> bestselling author Holly Black's stunning adult debut, <i>Book of Night</i>. This program features multicast narration.<br><br>\"[Narrator Sara] Amini's narration captures Charlie's trademark cynicism, as well as her heartbreak and feelings of vulnerability... As more characters are introduced, Amini expertly differentiates them, including several sinister-sounding shadows.\" — <i>AudioFile (Earphones Award Winner)</i></b><br><br>There'd always been something wrong with Charlie Hall. Crooked from the day she was born. Never met a bad decision she wasn't willing to double down on. She may be good enough to steal a shadow from a tower, but will she be good enough to steal back a heart?<br><br><b>A Macmillan Audio production from Tor Books</b></p>"; 
